  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatched in the Mud Flats, 'Patches' witnessed the brutal realities of Subchain City early. He lost his flock to a DRIP raid gone south and now wanders the ruins, haunted by phantom memories and fueled by a thirst for vengeance... and maybe a little DRIP along the way.",
    "class": "Gutter Punk Ronin",
    "name": "Patches 'Soulclick' Mallory",
    "personality": "Patches is a brooding and cynical duck, a consequence of witnessing too much loss. However, he carries a strange, morbid attachment to a tattered plushie he calls 'Quackie,' a silent confidant that seems to be his only source of comfort. Beneath the hardened exterior, there's a flicker of loyalty, but trust is a luxury he can no longer afford.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Soulclick's 'Phantomfeather Frenzy' allows him to briefly tap into the echoes of past battles, increasing his evasion and attack speed for a short duration. The bloodstains on his face glow ominously as he becomes a whirlwind of claw and beak, leaving a trail of confusion in his wake.",
      "name": "Phantomfeather Frenzy"
